WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.891
Plan a festival activity that benefits the whole community

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:09.487
Festival: a community celebration of culture, history or religion. Heritage:

00:00:09.487 --> 00:00:12.359
traditions and knowledge passed through generations.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:19.068
Durbar: a formal gathering often featuring chiefs and community members. Unity: the

00:00:19.068 --> 00:00:23.470
feeling of working and belonging together. Cultural preservation: protecting

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:25.915
meaningful traditions for future generations.

00:00:26.783 --> 00:00:31.989
Create a festival poster showing a tradition, a shared value and a community benefit.
